               10  WS-To-PA-Seq-No       Pic S9(04)              Comp.  01850000
               10  WS-Status             Pic  X(12).                    01860015
             07  WS-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01870000
               88  WS-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01880000
