           Perform C100-Verify                                          03130011
      *                                                                 03140011
           Evaluate True                                                03150000
             When R115IPA0-In-Get-1st                                   03160000
               Perform C200-Initialize-Output                           03170011
               Perform D000-Get-1st                                     03180000
               Perform E000-Get-Next                                    03190000
      *                                                                 03200000
             When R115IPA0-In-Get-Next                                  03210000
