               Perform E000-Get-Next                                    03230000
      *                                                                 03240000
             When R115IPA0-In-Select                                    03250000
               Perform C200-Initialize-Output                           03260011
               Perform F000-Select                                      03270000
      *                                                                 03280000
             When R115IPA0-In-Insert                                    03290000
