             When R115IPA0-In-Upd-Status                                03332023
               Perform H050-Upd-Status                                  03333023
      *                                                                 03340000
             When R115IPA0-In-Delete                                    03350000
               Perform I000-Delete                                      03360000
      *                                                                 03370000
             When Other                                                 03380000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    03390000
               Move  'GL-IN-AKSJON-UV'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  03400000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03410000
               Move  R115IPA0-In-Action  To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03420000
