      *################################################################.03920000
       D100-Prepare-Input                Section.                       03930000
      *                                                                 03940000
      * We create internal from- and to-values, depending on the input. 03950000
      *                                                                 03960000
           Initialize                          WE-Cursor-Info           03970000
      *                                                                 03980000
           Move  R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    WE-Fin-Inst-ID           03990000
           Move  R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst-No To    WE-Fin-Inst-No           04000000
      *                                                                 04010000
           Move  R115IPA0-In-Contract-Type                              04020000
                                         To    WE-Contract-Type         04030000
           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  04040006
           Inspect WE-Contract-Type     Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04050006
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04060006
               Inspect WE-Contract-Type  Converting '* ' to '%%'        04070006
           End-If                                                       04080006
      *                                                                 04090000
           Move  R115IPA0-In-Contract-No To    WE-Contract-No           04100018
      *                                                                 04110000
           Move  R115IPA0-In-CA-Currency To    WE-CA-Currency           04120007
           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  04130007
           Inspect WE-CA-Currency       Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04140007
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04150007
               Inspect WE-CA-Currency    Converting '* ' to '%%'        04160007
           End-If                                                       04170007
      *                                                                 04180007
           Evaluate True                                                04190000
             When R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No  =     +0                       04200000
               Move  +0001               To    WE-From-PA-Seq-No        04210000
               Move  +9999               To    WE-To-PA-Seq-No          04220000
                                                                        04230000
             When other                                                 04240000
               Move  R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No                              04250000
                                         To    WE-From-PA-Seq-No        04260000
               Move  R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No                              04270000
                                         To    WE-To-PA-Seq-No          04280000
                                                                        04290000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04300000
      *                                                                 04310000
           Move  R115IPA0-In-Status      To    WE-Status                04320015
           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  04330015
           Inspect WE-Status            Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04340015
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04350015
               Inspect WE-Status         Converting '* ' to '%%'        04360015
           End-If                                                       04370015
      *                                                                 04380015
           .                                                            04390000
      *################################################################.04400000
       D200-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       04410000
      *                                                                 04420000
      * We store the qualification, so that we can check that the       04430000
      * qualification do not change on any following Get-Next.          04440000
      *                                                                 04450000
           Initialize                          WS-Cursor-Info           04460000
           Move  WE-Key                  To    WS-Key                   04470000
           Move  WE-Code-Sequence        To    WS-Code-Sequence         04480000
      *                                                                 04490000
           Initialize WC-Counters                                       04500000
      *                                                                 04510000
      * We check that we do not have any "negative" intervals.          04520000
      * DB2 is not very fond of those...                                04530000
      *                                                                 04540000
      * We fill in the SQL host variables.                              04550000
      *                                                                 04560000
           Initialize                          W-DB-Key                 04570000
      *                                                                 04580000
           Move  WE-Fin-Inst-ID          To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         04590000
           Move  WE-Contract-Type        To    W-DB-Contract-Type       04600000
      *                                                                 04610000
           Move  WE-Contract-No          To    W-DB-Contract-No         04620018
      *                                                                 04630000
           Move  WE-CA-Currency          To    W-DB-CA-Currency         04640000
           Move  WE-From-PA-Seq-No       To    W-DB-From-PA-Seq-No      04650000
           Move  WE-To-PA-Seq-No         To    W-DB-To-PA-Seq-No        04660000
      *                                                                 04670000
           If  WE-Fin-Inst-No            Not = Space                    04680000
           and W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          =     +0                       04690000
               Move  WE-Fin-Inst-No      To    W-Fin-Inst-No            04700000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           04710000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         04720000
           End-If                                                       04730000
      *                                                                 04740000
           Move  WE-Status               To    W-DB-Status              04750015
      *                                                                 04760015
           .                                                            04770000
      *################################################################.04780000
       D300-Select-Cursor                Section.                       04790000
      *                                                                 04800000
      * We choose which cursor to use, depending on the qualification.  04810000
      *                                                                 04820000
           Move  Space                   To    SW-Cursor-Code           04830000
      *                                                                 04840000
           If  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          Not = +0                       04850000
               Set  Sw-Use-Fin-Inst      To    True                     04860000
           End-If                                                       04870000
      *                                                                 04880000
           If  W-DB-Contract-Type        Not = Space                    04890004
           and W-DB-Contract-Type (1:1)  Not = '%'                      04900004
               Set   SW-Use-Contract-Type                               04910000
                                         To    True                     04920000
           End-If                                                       04930004
      *                                                                 04940000
           If  W-DB-Contract-No          Not = +0                       04950018
               Set   SW-Use-Contract-No  To    True                     04960000
           End-If                                                       04970018
      *                                                                 04980000
           If  R115IPA0-In-CA-Currency   Not = Space                    04990004
           or  R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No     Not = +0                       05000004
               Set  Sw-Use-Part-Amount   To    True                     05010000
           End-If                                                       05020000
      *                                                                 05030000
           If  W-DB-Status               Not = Space                    05040015
           and W-DB-Status (1:1)         Not = '%'                      05050015
               Set   SW-Use-Status       To    True                     05060015
           End-If                                                       05070015
      *                                                                 05080015
           Evaluate True                                                05090000
             When SW-Use-Fi-Asc                                         05100000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-Asc                                      05110000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Asc                                   05120000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-PA-Asc                                05130000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-St-Asc                                      05140015
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-St-Asc                                   05150015
               Continue                                                 05160000
      *                                                                 05170000
             When other                                                 05180000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05190000
               Move  'GL-CURSOR-UV'      To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05200000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05210000
               Move  SW-Cursor-Code      To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05220000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05230000
               Move  'D302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05240000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05250000
      *                                                                 05260000
           End-Evaluate                                                 05270000
      *                                                                 05280000
           .                                                            05290000
      *################################################################.05300000
