                                         To    True                     05360000
           Move  R115IPA0-In-Table-Version                              05370011
                                         To    R115IPAS-In-Table-Version05380011
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115IPAS-Cursor-Code     05390000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115IPAS-DB-Key          05400000
      *                                                                 05410000
