                                         To    R115IPAS-In-Table-Version05660011
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115IPAS-Cursor-Code     05670000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115IPAS-DB-Key          05680000
      *                                                                 05690000
           Call  'F115IPAR'              Using R115IPAS-SQL-Submodules  05700000
                                               DCLTF-Part-Amount        05710000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      05720000
           End-Call                                                     05730000
      *                                                                 05740000
