           End-If                                                       05960000
      *                                                                 05970000
           .                                                            05980000
      *################################################################.05990000
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       06000000
      *                                                                 06010000
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         06020000
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     06030000
      * the Get-1st.                                                    06040000
      *                                                                 06050000
           Evaluate True                                                06060000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06070000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06080000
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          06090000
               Continue                                                 06100000
      *                                                                 06110000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06120000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06130000
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         06140000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06150000
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06160000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06170000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06180000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06190000
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06200000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06210000
      *                                                                 06220000
             When Other                                                 06230000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06240000
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06250000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06260000
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06270000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06280000
      *                                                                 06290000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06300000
      *                                                                 06310000
           .                                                            06320000
