           Initialize                          R115IPAS-SQL-Submodules  06360000
           Set   R115IPAS-Version        To    True                     06370000
           Set   R115IPAS-In-Fetch-Cursor                               06380000
                                         To    True                     06390000
           Move  R115IPA0-In-Table-Version                              06400011
                                         To    R115IPAS-In-Table-Version06410011
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115IPAS-Cursor-Code     06420000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115IPAS-DB-Key          06430000
      *                                                                 06440000
           Call  'F115IPAR'              Using R115IPAS-SQL-Submodules  06450000
                                               DCLTF-Part-Amount        06460000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06470000
           End-Call                                                     06480000
      *                                                                 06490000
           Evaluate True                                                06500000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    06510000
               Add   +1                  To    WC-Row-No                06520000
      *                                                                 06530000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 06540000
               Set   WS-Cursor-End       To    True                     06550000
               If  WC-Row-No             =     +0                       06560000
                 Then                                                   06570000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06580000
                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              06590000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06600000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06610000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06620000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06630000
                 Else                                                   06640000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06650000
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06660000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06670000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06680000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06690000
               End-If                                                   06700000
      *                                                                 06710000
             When other                                                 06720000
               Move  'E201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06730000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06740000
      *                                                                 06750000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06760000
      *                                                                 06770000
           .                                                            06780000
      *################################################################.06790000
       F000-Select                       Section.                       06800000
      *                                                                 06810000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           06820000
      *                                                                 06830000
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       06840000
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               06850000
      *                                                                 06860000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        06870000
      *                                                                 06880000
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     06890000
      *                                                                 06900000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         06910000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 06920000
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  06930000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   06940000
           End-If                                                       06950000
      *                                                                 06960000
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       06970000
      *                                                                 06980000
           Evaluate True                                                06990000
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  07000000
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Part-Amount        07010000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 07020000
      *                                                                 07030000
             When other                                                 07040000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    07050000
               Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF-Q' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07060000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07070000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07080000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)07090000
               Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID  To WD-Fin-Inst-ID              07100000
               Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No    To WD-Contract-No              07110000
               Move  TFPA-Seq-No         To WD-PA-Seq-No                07120000
               String WD-Fin-Inst-ID           Delimited by size        07130000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07140000
                      FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       Delimited by space       07150000
                      WD-Contract-No           Delimited by size        07160000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07170000
                      FK-TFCA-Currency         Delimited by space       07180000
                      WD-PA-Seq-No             Delimited by size        07190000
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)07200000
               End-String                                               07210000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               07220000
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              07230000
                                         To    True                     07240000
      *                                                                 07250000
           End-Evaluate                                                 07260000
      *                                                                 07270000
           .                                                            07280000
      *################################################################.07290000
       F100-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       07300000
